<title>UK: Beta Finance sets 5.0 bln escudo five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Beta Finance sets 5.0 bln escudo five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Citibank Portugal SA and Citibank International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BETA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    5.0 BLN PTE   COUPON     6.85	MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
